{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView(im)setTargetCoordinate:animated:completionHandler:","title":"setTargetCoordinate:animated:completionHandler:","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTargetCoordinate:animated:completionHandler:"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapView.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapView.h#L816"},"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"text":"setTargetCoordinate:animated:completionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/setTargetCoordinate:animated:completionHandler:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets the geographic coordinate that is the subject of observation as the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location is being tracked, with an optional transition animation and completion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTargetCoordinate:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"targetCoordinate","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"animated:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"animated","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completionHandler:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","